{"_meta":{"openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Estimaci\u00f3n lista","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Estimando IRPF, cuota y neto","securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Use this when an aut\u00f3nomo in mainland Spain or Baleares asks roughly how much IRPF and cuota de aut\u00f3nomos they would pay in a year and how much they would keep, from yearly income, expenses and comunidad aut\u00f3noma. Income and expenses are yearly amounts without recoverable VAT and without their own cuota de aut\u00f3nomos (the tool adds the cuota). Assumes a full year in estimaci\u00f3n directa simplificada, individual filing, no other income, and the minimum cuota of their tramo unless they give theirs. An annual estimate, not a quarterly modelo 130 or 303 amount, and without regional deductions. tipo_medio_irpf is the IRPF over gross income. Do not use for employees, companies, Canarias, Pa\u00eds Vasco, Navarra, Ceuta or Melilla, or a connected client's real returns.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"age":{"default":35,"maximum":100,"minimum":18,"type":"integer"},"annual_expenses":{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"annual_income":{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"children":{"default":0,"maximum":10,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"monthly_cuota":{"description":"Their real monthly cuota de aut\u00f3nomos, if they know it.","maximum":100000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"region":{"enum":["andalucia","aragon","asturias","baleares","cantabria","castilla_leon","castilla_mancha","cataluna","extremadura","galicia","madrid","murcia","rioja","valencia","canarias","pais_vasco","navarra","ceuta","melilla"],"type":"string"},"year":{"enum":[2025,2026],"type":"integer"}},"required":["year","annual_income","annual_expenses","region"],"type":"object"},"name":"kuotia_estimate_net_income","outputSchema":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProp